# macOS metadata must never enter the work image build context.
#
# Files authored on macOS carry extended attributes (com.apple.provenance is
# system-protected and cannot be removed with xattr -c). When the tree is
# packaged or copied through a filesystem or archiver without native xattr
# support, each xattr-bearing file gains a binary AppleDouble "._<name>"
# sidecar alongside it.
#
# Those sidecars match the estimators' *.json / *.jsonl globs. The estimators
# enumerate with pathlib.Path.glob, which - unlike glob.glob - does not apply
# the POSIX dotfile rule, so the sidecars are read as UTF-8 and raise
# UnicodeDecodeError on the AppleDouble header, aborting the agent.
#
# Patterns are matched against the full path relative to the build context,
# not the basename, so the "**/" variants are required to catch sidecars in
# subdirectories. Do not remove them.
._*
**/._*
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
__MACOSX/
**/__MACOSX/
.dockerignore
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/*.pyc
